    "body": "> I added a note clarifying that [named properties objects](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#named-properties-object) don’t have any real properties, so its ordinary [[OwnPropertyKeys]] won’t return any supported named properties,\r\n\r\nYes, I think that'd definitely be helpful.\r\n\r\n> a note clarifying that [Window](https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/#window)’s named properties use the rules for [named properties objects](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#named-properties-object) rather than [legacy platform objects](https://webidl.spec.whatwg.org/#es-legacy-platform-objects)?\r\n\r\nYeah, adding something like that around https://html.spec.whatwg.org/multipage/nav-history-apis.html#named-access-on-the-window-object would make sense to me.",
